{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Knotgud disaster in this point and click deduction mystery. Explore the town of Knotgud, interrogate townsfolk, and use magical items. Use your discoveries to piece events together in your scroll of truth and find out, Who Summoned It?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Knotgud needs you! A terrible creature known as the Booglo has been summoned and torments the land! Thankfully Riki Rocktoe, the soft-boiled truthmeister is on the case. But he's not alone,  accompany Riki as the possessed Scroll of Truth that only allows true statements to be written on it. Yes, you're a piece of parchment. A <i>magical</i> piece of parchment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town and interrogate the good folk of Knotgud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of over twenty suspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the environment and scrutinize statements to reach conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical tools to aid you in your investigation. Look into the past with a cracked crystal ball, get into tiny spaces with all-purpose-rats. Smell the different colors of magic with an enchanted cat.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various mysteries throughout Knotgud in non-linear progression.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover  clues, phrases and use logical deduction to complete fill in the blank style mysteries.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.poster.avif?t=1759878880\" width=444 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.webm?t=1759878880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.mp4?t=1759878880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682850?t=1759878880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/82fc7ba647f5cc357c46330d36002a7e77b1d7fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759878880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/5717ecfc1e08a43ec1a630db1062780304d19731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759878880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/5717ecfc1e08a43ec1a630db1062780304d19731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759878880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Knotgud disaster in this point and click deduction mystery. Explore the town of Knotgud, interrogate townsfolk, and use magical items. Use your discoveries to piece events together in your scroll of truth and find out, Who Summoned It?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Knotgud needs you! A terrible creature known as the Booglo has been summoned and torments the land! Thankfully Riki Rocktoe, the soft-boiled truthmeister is on the case. But he's not alone,  accompany Riki as the possessed Scroll of Truth that only allows true statements to be written on it. Yes, you're a piece of parchment. A <i>magical</i> piece of parchment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town and interrogate the good folk of Knotgud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of over twenty suspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the environment and scrutinize statements to reach conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical tools to aid you in your investigation. Look into the past with a cracked crystal ball, get into tiny spaces with all-purpose-rats. Smell the different colors of magic with an enchanted cat.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various mysteries throughout Knotgud in non-linear progression.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover  clues, phrases and use logical deduction to complete fill in the blank style mysteries.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.poster.avif?t=1759878880\" width=444 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.webm?t=1759878880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/c7a3790045cba33b5288f2b076db6a68.mp4?t=1759878880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Crooked Foot"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/8190637bd30798fbfb933c05776982dd1400d753/header.jpg?t=1759878880","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682850/223531581/2d9d5de95f9d2097c5e60b0b3bea337a838302ff/1759255